<%- include('header') %>
<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">NEW RECORD</span><h1>登记新的救助线索</h1><p>先记录基本情况，让救助工作有据可循。</p></div><a class="button" href="/animals">返回列表</a></div>
<div class="form-layout"><section class="panel"><h2>动物基本资料</h2>
<% if (error) { %><p class="form-feedback" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %>
<form method="POST" action="/animals/new">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<%- include('animal-fields', { animal }) %>
<div class="form-actions actions"><a class="button" href="/animals">取消</a><button class="primary" type="submit">登记动物</button></div>
</form></section><aside class="panel form-aside"><span class="aside-symbol">＋</span><h2>一份档案的起点</h2><p>登记后从“待救助”开始。编号、登记人和初始状态由服务器生成。</p><ol class="steps"><li>登记动物资料</li><li>指定救助负责人</li><li>记录治疗与安置</li><li>寻找合适的新家</li></ol><span class="badge status-pending">初始状态：待救助</span></aside></div>
<%- include('footer') %>
